# Text files are LF in the repository and on every checkout. GTTK ships an ArcGIS
# Pro toolbox, so Windows clones are expected, and without this rule a clone made
# with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every .py, .md, .toml and .pyt.xml and reports
# them all as modified. Binary files are detected by git and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
